{"t":"Warzone 3","s":"warzone-3-80cf1","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Orewalker_e4e746.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Warzone 3</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Orewalker\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orewalker_e4e746.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Eastern part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomebase</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomebase%20Alpha\">Alpha</a>, here.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shiny%20Blade\"><img alt=\"Shiny Blade\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shiny_Blade_6863ae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystalline%20Axe\"><img alt=\"Crystalline Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystalline_Axe_75fc76.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Decorative%20Ribbon\"><img alt=\"Decorative Ribbon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Decorative_Ribbon_cc329b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mycological%20Mace\"><img alt=\"Mycological Mace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mycological_Mace_b40eaa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mycological%20Bow\"><img alt=\"Mycological Bow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mycological_Bow_74eaa4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">9.60</a><br/>July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>Through one of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Large%20Crystal%20Teleporter\">Crystal Teleporters</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomebase%20Alpha\">Gnomebase Alpha</a>, you need at least 1440 mission points and a special <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Teleport%20Crystal\">Red Teleport Crystal</a> in order to enter. You must also have completed <a href=\"#/wiki/Warzone%202\">Warzone 2</a> at least once.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hints\">Hints</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h3>\n<p>In order of frequency:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cliff%20Strider\">Cliff Strider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orewalker\">Orewalker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Berserker\">Lost Berserker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ironblight\">Ironblight</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Glacial%20Rod\">Glacial Rod</a></li>\n<li>Crystal Mace</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Crossbow\">Crystal Crossbow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Defiance\">Wand of Defiance</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other items will drop but these are of most interest.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Manadrain will rock you. All monsters except <a href=\"#/wiki/Ironblight\">Ironblights</a> (?) have strong manadrain attacks.</li>\n<li>Fields: Use energy walls for everything except <a href=\"#/wiki/Cliff%20Strider\">Cliff Striders</a>, as they walk through energy, but not through fire, thus use fire walls for Striders if you need to.</li>\n<li>Paladins: prepare for skill drain: <a href=\"#/wiki/Cliff%20Strider\">Cliff Striders</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Orewalker\">Orewalkers</a>.</li>\n<li>Stay diagonal to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ironblight\">Ironblights</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Orewalker\">Orewalkers</a>, they both have beams. Orewalkers have a thin manadrain wave.</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Quest\">Quest</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Focus on killing Versperoth and do not worry about the minions. The time spent killing minions will mean less damage to the boss and more time dealing with the minions.</li>\n<li>Cover Versperoth's room in <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">Energy Fields</a>, have your team spread out on the fields and move around when the minions spawn. This way, the golems will not melee you and, if positioned properly, they won't beam you either.</li>\n<li>Watch your health because there are many sources of damage in Versperoth's room: each lava golem is capable of dealing more than 1000 damage with just beams, and Versperoth's massive fire attack hits everyone near her for up to 700 or more.</li>\n<li>Abyssador attacks very wildly and this makes him harder to control. It is imperative that he is blocked to protect your shooters.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward_Chest\">Reward Chest</span></h3>\n<p>You will always get 5 out of the 9 items available, but you can never get more than one piece of a statue at the same time and chances to get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Miniature%20House\">Miniature House</a> are very slim.\n</p>\n<ul class=\"item-tile-list\"><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Major%20Crystalline%20Token\"><img alt=\"Major Crystalline Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Major_Crystalline_Token_acc0d8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\">2x <a href=\"#/wiki/Major%20Crystalline%20Token\">Major Crystalline Token</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Crystal%20Shard\"><img alt=\"Violet Crystal Shard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Violet_Crystal_Shard_55dfa2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\">12x <a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Crystal%20Shard\">Violet Crystal Shard</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Prismatic%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Prismatic Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Prismatic_Ring_9dbb7e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Prismatic%20Ring\">Prismatic Ring</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Crystal Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Coin_55f849.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\">5x <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mucus%20Plug\"><img alt=\"Mucus Plug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mucus_Plug_1d3cd6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Mucus%20Plug\">Mucus Plug</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Head%20of%20Abyssador\"><img alt=\"Head of Abyssador\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Head_of_Abyssador_987477.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Head%20of%20Abyssador\">Head of Abyssador</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Torso%20of%20Abyssador\"><img alt=\"Torso of Abyssador\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Torso_of_Abyssador_db57d1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Torso%20of%20Abyssador\">Torso of Abyssador</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tail%20of%20Abyssador\"><img alt=\"Tail of Abyssador\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tail_of_Abyssador_d0ec03.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Tail%20of%20Abyssador\">Tail of Abyssador</a></div></div></li><li><div class=\"item-tile no-pseudoelements-container\"><div class=\"item-tile-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Miniature%20House\"><img alt=\"Miniature House\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Miniature_House_df3b73.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></div><div class=\"item-tile-text\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Miniature%20House\">Miniature House</a></div></div></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Berserker\"><img alt=\"Lost Berserker\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lost_Berserker_5dddbd.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Berserker\">Lost Berserker</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">4,800</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">800</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>2-200× <a href=